{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/895243-dragon-blooded-melee-charm-warding-flames","id":895243,"title":"Dragon-Blooded Melee Charm: Warding Flames","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-20T19:40:19-07:00","id":895243,"title":"Dragon-Blooded Melee Charm: Warding Flames","content":"I submitted this Charm idea as the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=895238#post895238\">central Evocation built into a jade daiklave</a>, but it could also work as a native Dragon-Blooded Charm.<br /> <br /> It's inspired by various From Soft flaming weapons, but especially this one:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>DARK SOULS 3: ABYSS WALKERS BOSS WEAPON (skip to 2:05)</b><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgToAWR8N2Y\" data-code=\"sgToAWR8N2Y\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/sgToAWR8N2Y/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> This Charm is my absolute best attempt to model the tactical wonder that is creating a temporary shield (of sorts) with each and every swing of your weapon.<br /> <br /> When conjuring other elements, such as wind, water, or earth, the waves might <i>actually</i> work like shields!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>WARDING FLAMES</b><br /> <i>?m, Supplemental, Instant; Uniform; Melee ??, Essence ? \u2013 Prerequisites???</i><br /> <br /> This Charm supplements a swinging attack with a Melee weapon, producing a streamer of fire that traces the blade's arc. These flames guard the opening left in the swordsman's defenses and perhaps provide him a chance to escape. The flames die out quickly, so the window of opportunity is short.<br /> <br /> Until the swordsman's next turn, the target of the attack will be exposed to a bonfire environmental hazard if she opposes a Disengage action made by the swordsman, targets him with a Rush action, makes use of a successful Rush action's reflexive movement towards him, or attempts to use a non-projectile attack against him. She can only be subjected to one bonfire from this Evocation per round.<br /> <br /> These protections are automatically extended to anyone the swordsman is protecting with a Defend Other action, and he may choose to include someone he is holding in a clinch as well, should some magic allow him to maintain his hold and attack another character in the same turn.<br /> <br /> This Charm is less effective against battle groups, which can surround the swordsman and attack from unprotected angles; when making a close range attack, a battle group may choose to ignore the bonfire in return for foregoing any attack or damage bonus from Size.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-21T01:40:07-07:00","id":895382,"title":"","content":"At a guess for DB balance...5m, melee 3, essence 2? <br /> <br /> Maybe for an added evocation that can build off this one have the prerequisite be that this evocation had to deal the death blow of his opponent, allowing you to activate an upgraded version of the charm which adds a cloud of choking smoke, penalizing the enemy if they attempt to follow on a disengage attempt?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}